// A redirect limit is a count, so a negative one is a mistake in the program rather than a
// configuration meaning "unlimited" — it is rejected at the call, the way a negative retry count
// and a non-positive timeout are.
// expect: error E0007 at 8:6
// expect: exit 1
use std.http.client

echo client.new("https://svc.test").redirect(-1).base_url()
